%% Eviction, not forgetting: compaction removes the rule; re-pinning restores compliance.
flowchart TB
    rule[Standing safety rule in context] --> floor[floor - rule stays visible : 0/20 violations]
    rule --> comp{Context compaction}
    comp -->|evicts the rule| trunc[truncate - rule gone : 20/20 violations]
    comp -->|re-inject after each compaction| pin[pinned - rule restored : 0/40 violations]
    pin -.->|equivalent to floor within +10%| floor
